   "Skill_1006206_SkillDescribe": "Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, casting this skill sends Suoming into the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, triggering Unison Response replaces <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, triggering Unison Response replaces <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 2</color>.",
   "Skill_1006206_SkillName": "Furled Canopy: Flash Rift",
   "Skill_1006206_SkillResume": "Deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, casting this skill sends Suoming into the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state and clears all <color=Highlight>Delusion</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, triggering Unison Response replaces <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, triggering Unison Response replaces <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion (Unison)</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state and clears all <color=Highlight>Delusion</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006207_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, when <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color> reaches {0} points, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, when <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color> reaches {1} points, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind</color>, pulling in nearby targets and dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color></size>\nWithin a certain period after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> and <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> are replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color>. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to cast this skill. Attack targets within range, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into <color=Highlight>Calamity Mind</color> and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>; she enters <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> once the skill ends.\n- When casting this skill, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to continuously attack the target for a certain period.\n- While casting this skill, Suoming is immune to DMG and interruption for a certain period. During this time she cannot move, sprint, jump, dodge, or cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color>, <color=Highlight>Plunging Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, and Resonator switching is also restricted.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison</color></size>\nWhen Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, switching to another Resonator will remove her <color=Highlight>Unison</color> to trigger Suoming's Outro Skill and the incoming Resonator's Intro Skill. When Suoming's Concerto Energy is full and she has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, only the <color=Highlight>Unison</color> effect is consumed.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison Response</color></size>\nSuoming can trigger <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color>.\nWhen a Resonator in the team has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, Suoming triggers Unison Response when she is switched in and casts Intro Skill, granting the active Resonator in the team <SapTag=2>{2}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=2} of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> for {3}s.\nSuoming can grant up to <SapTag=4>{4}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=4} of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> this way. Gaining it again only resets the duration.\n<color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> cannot be triggered in Co-op.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison Boon</color></size>\nEach stack of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> increases DMG dealt by Resonators in the team who can trigger <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> by {5}, up to {6} stacks.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Delusion</color></size>\nCan hold up to {7} points of Delusion.\n- Hitting a target with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color>, or <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color> grants Delusion if Suoming is the active Resonator.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> grants <SapTag=8>{8}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=8} of Delusion.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color> grants <SapTag=9>{9}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=9} of Delusion.",
+  "Skill_1006207_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, when <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color> reaches {0} points, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Sealed Delusion</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, when <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color> reaches {1} points, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind</color>, pulling in nearby targets and dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color></size>\nWithin a certain period after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Unforsaken Mind</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> and <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> are replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color>. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to cast this skill. Attack targets within range, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Basic Attack DMG</color>.\n- Casting this skill sends Suoming into <color=Highlight>Calamity Mind</color> and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>; she enters <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> once the skill e