112>Unison Response</te></color> by {5}, up to {6} stacks.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Delusion</color></size>\nCan hold up to {7} points of Delusion.\n- Hitting a target with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color>, or <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color> grants <color=Highlight>Delusion</color> if Suoming is the active Resonator.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> grants <SapTag=8>{8}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=8} of <color=Highlight>Delusion</color>.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color> grants <SapTag=9>{9}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=9} of <color=Highlight>Delusion</color>.",
